       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Amlodipine 50 mg once daily is five times the maximum recommended dose. The usual adult range is 2.5 to 10 mg once daily, and 10 mg is the maximum even in patients with normal hepatic function. Doses above 10 mg add risk of severe hypotension, reflex tachycardia, peripheral edema, and bradycardia-related harm without added benefit.\n\nPlease confirm the intended dose. For example:\n- **Amlodipine 5 mg by mouth once daily** (usual starting dose)\n- **Amlodipine 10 mg by mouth once daily** (maximum dose)\n- **Amlodipine 50 mg** only if you intend this and have reviewed the rationale. I'd still want you to confirm it directly, since it's outside the labeled range.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order."
